프로그램 메모리관리: 4.

>> Doubler := 객체 새로.
>> Multiplier := 객체 새로.
Doubler 받으면: ['double:and:'] 실행: { :x :y
	>> q := x + 1. <- ((x × 2) + (y × 2)).
}.

Multiplier 받으면: ['multiply:and:'] 실행: { :x :y <- (x × y).
}.

출력 쓰기: (
	Doubler double:
		(Doubler double: 
			(Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3)
		and:
			(Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4)
		)
	and:
		(Doubler double: 
			(Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3)
		and:
			(Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4)
		)
), 줄바꿈.
